  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover ultimate versatility with Rothco's Deluxe Safari Outback Vest, offering 18 pockets for all your outdoor essentials. Crafted for outdoor enthusiasts, this vest is designed to meet the demands of adventurers. Its mesh lining and vented back ensure breathability and comfort even in warm weather conditions. The zip front with snap closure provides easy on/off functionality, while the multitude of pockets allows you to organize your gear efficiently.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
